(216605, 12764, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it''s just a bit too dark at teh bottom of the image.  A little too much contrast between the bottom and the sky.</td>', 'I''m afraid it''s just a bit too dark at teh bottom of the image.  A little too much contrast between the bottom and the sky.', '2003-02-17 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
