(216648, 12620, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love the colors and textures here.  i probably would have cropped it a little tighter at the top...the vent (?) at the top left is a little distracting.  great shot, though!</td>', 'i love the colors and textures here.  i probably would have cropped it a little tighter at the top...the vent (?) at the top left is a little distracting.  great shot, though!', '2003-02-17 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
