(216735, 12567, 3900, '<td valign="top">Wo, you definitely have one out of rhythm!  Looks like something I pulled out of UFO catcher last week...never could figure out what I was supposed to do with them...sit around and look kind of cute, collect dust, and cat hair.  Anyway, this would''ve worked well in the Yellow challenge.  Good focus.</td>', 'Wo, you definitely have one out of rhythm!  Looks like something I pulled out of UFO catcher last week...never could figure out what I was supposed to do with them...sit around and look kind of cute, collect dust, and cat hair.  Anyway, this would''ve worked well in the Yellow challenge.  Good focus.', '2003-02-17 01:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(216739, 12371, 3607, '<td valign="top">seu photo nao e um photo de ''rhythm'', mais era muito bem feito.  mais sem duvida voce tinha muito mais oportunidades de ritmo no brasil!  por favor!</td>', 'seu photo nao e um photo de ''rhythm'', mais era muito bem feito.  mais sem duvida voce tinha muito mais oportunidades de ritmo no brasil!  por favor!', '2003-02-17 01:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
