(216750, 12394, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice photo and it meets the challenge well.  i hope this isn''t your back yard ;-)</td>', 'nice photo and it meets the challenge well.  i hope this isn''t your back yard ;-)', '2003-02-17 01:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(216754, 12420, 3607, '<td valign="top">if the sky were blue in the background, i would give you an 11.  so instead, i guess i had to give you just a 10.  this is so what i wish i could have done for this competition.  chaos but ordered . . . very well done.</td>', 'if the sky were blue in the background, i would give you an 11.  so instead, i guess i had to give you just a 10.  this is so what i wish i could have done for this competition.  chaos but ordered . . . very well done.', '2003-02-17 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
