(218543, 12403, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great abstract. Nice job...</td>', 'Great abstract. Nice job...', '2003-02-18 10:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(218545, 12646, 5515, '<td valign="top">Metals are real tough to capture correctly. You''ve done an admirable job... nice image. My eye wants the circle completed though. Love the repetative circles a lot. Great job overall... Dave</td>', 'Metals are real tough to capture correctly. You''ve done an admirable job... nice image. My eye wants the circle completed though. Love the repetative circles a lot. Great job overall... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(218546, 12736, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great eye, wonderful capture... Dave</td>', 'Great eye, wonderful capture... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(218548, 12636, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice job... Dave</td>', 'Great shot. Nice job... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(218552, 12578, 5515, '<td valign="top">My favorite this week. I would have prefered a tighter shot looking straight up of the stair and totally do with out the building. The angle thte the building is at make the image look a little off balance. Still this is my winner for the week. Thanks for sharing it... Dave</td>', 'My favorite this week. I would have prefered a tighter shot looking straight up of the stair and totally do with out the building. The angle thte the building is at make the image look a little off balance. Still this is my winner for the week. Thanks for sharing it... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(218555, 12475, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great symetry shot. Wonderful image and truly captures the spirit of the topic. Was this shot wide angle? I am seeing some weird perspective lines. That is my only critique on this image left side is straight, right side is crooked.  Still a wonderful rhythm shot... Dave</td>', 'Great symetry shot. Wonderful image and truly captures the spirit of the topic. Was this shot wide angle? I am seeing some weird perspective lines. That is my only critique on this image left side is straight, right side is crooked.  Still a wonderful rhythm shot... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(218556, 12602, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great shot, wonderful perspective. Shot from a bridge? Nice image...</td>', 'Great shot, wonderful perspective. Shot from a bridge? Nice image...', '2003-02-18 10:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(218561, 12566, 5515, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture. The softness of the blues is wonderful. Great job... dave</td>', 'Really nice capture. The softness of the blues is wonderful. Great job... dave', '2003-02-18 10:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(218563, 12620, 5515, '<td valign="top">Great texture. Really wonderful shot.</td>', 'Great texture. Really wonderful shot.', '2003-02-18 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218566, 12498, 5515, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Just saw the same subject in the "song title" final, maybe to recent to see again?  Shows rhythm well though... Dave</td>', 'Really nice shot. Just saw the same subject in the "song title" final, maybe to recent to see again?  Shows rhythm well though... Dave', '2003-02-18 10:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(218671, 12752, 3724, '<td valign="top">this room looks familiar, for me it is an attic in the gem theater in new richmond wi, where an elderly priest had a library of old latin liturgical volumes.......   also it reminds me of the library in Super Mario 64.  Nice library shot.....   i love it in b &amp; w.</td>', 'this room looks familiar, for me it is an attic in the gem theater in new richmond wi, where an elderly priest had a library of old latin liturgical volumes.......   also it reminds me of the library in Super Mario 64.  Nice library shot.....   i love it in b & w.', '2003-02-18 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(218692, 12496, 3724, '<td valign="top">beautiful instrument.........  i wonder if i could hook this up to my home theater.  very good picture.......</td>', 'beautiful instrument.........  i wonder if i could hook this up to my home theater.  very good picture.......', '2003-02-18 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(218703, 12748, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot!  I think this will definitely make the top 10 if not the top 3.    This shot may have also gave everyone a run in the yellow challenge as well.  Really nice for just a stack of plastic cups.  I just really like to contrast of the white on the rims against the yellow of the cups.  <br/></td>', 'This is an awesome shot!  I think this will definitely make the top 10 if not the top 3.    This shot may have also gave everyone a run in the yellow challenge as well.  Really nice for just a stack of plastic cups.  I just really like to contrast of the white on the rims against the yellow of the cups.  ', '2003-02-18 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(218704, 12566, 6097, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color of blue.  Very nice sharp focus.  Excellent shot.  Impressive.</td>', 'Beautiful color of blue.  Very nice sharp focus.  Excellent shot.  Impressive.', '2003-02-18 12:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(218705, 12658, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF.  Love the color and how they all seem to be different shades of red.  Definitely has rhythm.</td>', 'Very nice DOF.  Love the color and how they all seem to be different shades of red.  Definitely has rhythm.', '2003-02-18 12:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(218712, 12636, 6100, '<td valign="top">Your viewpoint is excellent. Reminds me of the rows of tombstones in a military cemetary, each perfectly aligned with its neighbor. DOF is good.</td>', 'Your viewpoint is excellent. Reminds me of the rows of tombstones in a military cemetary, each perfectly aligned with its neighbor. DOF is good.', '2003-02-18 12:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(218713, 12426, 6100, '<td valign="top">Maybe its just me but this seems slightly out of focus (maybe it''s the blue). Good concept.</td>', 'Maybe its just me but this seems slightly out of focus (maybe it''s the blue). Good concept.', '2003-02-18 12:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(218715, 12679, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice job! Definately has a rhythm to it and the colors add to it.</td>', 'Nice job! Definately has a rhythm to it and the colors add to it.', '2003-02-18 12:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218717, 12667, 6100, '<td valign="top">There''s a rhythm here but, other than that, it just seems to be a picture of a building along with a washed out sky. Still, you''ve kept most building lines fairly straight and I like that.</td>', 'There''s a rhythm here but, other than that, it just seems to be a picture of a building along with a washed out sky. Still, you''ve kept most building lines fairly straight and I like that.', '2003-02-18 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(218719, 12742, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2003-02-18 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(218720, 12475, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject for this challenge. I like cropping at the top which helps the viewer imply that this goes on forever. The B/W effect probably strengthens this. The only thing I can see that might help is to keep the vertical lines straight up and down.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject for this challenge. I like cropping at the top which helps the viewer imply that this goes on forever. The B/W effect probably strengthens this. The only thing I can see that might help is to keep the vertical lines straight up and down.', '2003-02-18 12:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(218721, 12613, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nature still presents us with some of the best rhythm, doesn''t it. Beautiful picture.</td>', 'Nature still presents us with some of the best rhythm, doesn''t it. Beautiful picture.', '2003-02-18 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(218747, 12736, 1379, '<td valign="top">I hoped someone would catch a group of people dancing, and you did!  I love their hats, their ties, their boots, their tight pants (!), everything!  This is rhythm in many senses!</td>', 'I hoped someone would catch a group of people dancing, and you did!  I love their hats, their ties, their boots, their tight pants (!), everything!  This is rhythm in many senses!', '2003-02-18 14:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(218808, 12629, 4007, '<td valign="top">It has a sort of dark cryptic look to it. I like the texture very much.  Good work. 8</td>', 'It has a sort of dark cryptic look to it. I like the texture very much.  Good work. 8', '2003-02-18 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(218812, 12420, 4007, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this shot ends up just looking like chaos.  The numerous lines in this picture don''t form any strong patterns or structures (even though I''m sure they do in real life).  Perhaps the subject is just too cluttered to come up with a good clear shot from, or perhaps another angle would have yeilded better results.  I also think the barbed wire and lightpost don''t add to the shot, but instead add to the clutter.  Good luck. 3</td>', 'Unfortunately, this shot ends up just looking like chaos.  The numerous lines in this picture don''t form any strong patterns or structures (even though I''m sure they do in real life).  Perhaps the subject is just too cluttered to come up with a good clear shot from, or perhaps another angle would have yeilded better results.  I also think the barbed wire and lightpost don''t add to the shot, but instead add to the clutter.  Good luck. 3', '2003-02-18 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(218822, 12688, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the negative space at the top is necessary, but it doesn''t really detract from the shot.  I like the concept and I find it interesting that you used balls with different numbers, showing that it obviously was not one ball in motion.  I think the lighting should have been better distributed so as to avoid the right side being overexposed, and to avoid the shadows.  I enjoyed this shot. 6</td>', 'I''m not sure if the negative space at the top is necessary, but it doesn''t really detract from the shot.  I like the concept and I find it interesting that you used balls with different numbers, showing that it obviously was not one ball in motion.  I think the lighting should have been better distributed so as to avoid the right side being overexposed, and to avoid the shadows.  I enjoyed this shot. 6', '2003-02-18 18:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(218835, 12368, 3447, '<td valign="top">Harmony/Rythm?  In any event your photograph is beautiful.  Love the color tones and your use of light.  Even your border is well done, although I do not include that as points for a photographer.  Top three for certain.</td>', 'Harmony/Rythm?  In any event your photograph is beautiful.  Love the color tones and your use of light.  Even your border is well done, although I do not include that as points for a photographer.  Top three for certain.', '2003-02-18 19:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(218837, 12681, 3447, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and pattern.  As always, more DOF is desireable, and lower left is distractingly bright.</td>', 'Very nice colors and pattern.  As always, more DOF is desireable, and lower left is distractingly bright.', '2003-02-18 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(218843, 12699, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what I''m looking at, but it is definitely one of the best abstract images I''ve seen here in a while!  Looks like the kind of thing that could be blown up into an interesting poster.  -9</td>', 'Not quite sure what I''m looking at, but it is definitely one of the best abstract images I''ve seen here in a while!  Looks like the kind of thing that could be blown up into an interesting poster.  -9', '2003-02-18 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(218844, 12578, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun, very colorful shot.  Nice &amp; crisp!  I like the fact that none of the paint is blue -- the only area of the shot that has blue is the sky.  That makes it even more interesting as far as I''m concerned!</td>', 'It''s a fun, very colorful shot.  Nice & crisp!  I like the fact that none of the paint is blue -- the only area of the shot that has blue is the sky.  That makes it even more interesting as far as I''m concerned!', '2003-02-18 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(218845, 12759, 4411, '<td valign="top">Best of the challenge.<br/>The colour makes the strings stand out really well, and a depth of field like this always works well on a guitar. A classic shot well executed, and a funky looking guitar.</td>', 'Best of the challenge.The colour makes the strings stand out really well, and a depth of field like this always works well on a guitar. A classic shot well executed, and a funky looking guitar.', '2003-02-18 19:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(218862, 12662, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the crop on this shot, and I think the subject works very well.  I think the title is too over the top (but that''s not the type of thing I''d take off points for).  Solid photo. 7</td>', 'I like the crop on this shot, and I think the subject works very well.  I think the title is too over the top (but that''s not the type of thing I''d take off points for).  Solid photo. 7', '2003-02-18 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(218863, 12737, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the subject makes for a very interesting photograph, at least not from this angle.  The lighting is too dim as well.  Perhaps an overhead shot or an angle that would create symetry would create a more interesting effect.  A plain white backdrop might be something to experiment with as well. 3</td>', 'I don''t think the subject makes for a very interesting photograph, at least not from this angle.  The lighting is too dim as well.  Perhaps an overhead shot or an angle that would create symetry would create a more interesting effect.  A plain white backdrop might be something to experiment with as well. 3', '2003-02-18 20:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(218864, 12426, 4007, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I don''t think I like the framing of the shot.  Maybe rotating the shot so that the bottom line of the blue object would parallel the bottom edge of the frame would create a good effect.  Currently the visable blue shapes seem somewhat random and don''t really have any pattern or form. 4</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I don''t think I like the framing of the shot.  Maybe rotating the shot so that the bottom line of the blue object would parallel the bottom edge of the frame would create a good effect.  Currently the visable blue shapes seem somewhat random and don''t really have any pattern or form. 4', '2003-02-18 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(218867, 12666, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I think you should either leave enough of the street level in the shot for the viewer to really see what is going on or else cut it out completely.  I personally would probably crop the bottom boarder a little higher to reduce the clutter that shows up at the bottom. 5</td>', 'I like the concept.  I think you should either leave enough of the street level in the shot for the viewer to really see what is going on or else cut it out completely.  I personally would probably crop the bottom boarder a little higher to reduce the clutter that shows up at the bottom. 5', '2003-02-18 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
