(219091, 12745, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work... the ''rhythm'' flows nicely in your shot... the color also pops very well :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice work... the ''rhythm'' flows nicely in your shot... the color also pops very well :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(219097, 12756, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this shot quite a bit... ''form and function'' fascinates me and i shoot a lot of similar images... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'I like this shot quite a bit... ''form and function'' fascinates me and i shoot a lot of similar images... great work :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 11:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(219104, 12602, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... this shot works for ''rhythm'' in more ways that one... the repepating patterns and the implied motion both support the topic very well... the contrast with the black and white is also nice :)  i can''t really offer any improvement here... i think, maybe a horizontal mirror of this shot would be effective also... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... this shot works for ''rhythm'' in more ways that one... the repepating patterns and the implied motion both support the topic very well... the contrast with the black and white is also nice :)  i can''t really offer any improvement here... i think, maybe a horizontal mirror of this shot would be effective also... great work :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 11:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(219113, 12392, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract... it has a glass quality to it... maybe it is glass... great shot and great ''rhythm'' also :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice abstract... it has a glass quality to it... maybe it is glass... great shot and great ''rhythm'' also :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 11:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(219114, 12752, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent black and white... I love the leading lines up to the bright window... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent black and white... I love the leading lines up to the bright window... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 11:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(219116, 12588, 806, '<td valign="top">cool title! nice sharpness and contrasts. rhythm in the concentric circles in the logs, and a bit of chaos in the pile of logs.. but still flows.</td>', 'cool title! nice sharpness and contrasts. rhythm in the concentric circles in the logs, and a bit of chaos in the pile of logs.. but still flows.', '2003-02-19 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(219120, 12603, 806, '<td valign="top">cool catch.. wish it were in better focus.. or maybe that is compression? .. and framing it horizontally would further accentuate the line of birds.. <br/>interesting how they lined up right at each post, too. cool.</td>', 'cool catch.. wish it were in better focus.. or maybe that is compression? .. and framing it horizontally would further accentuate the line of birds.. interesting how they lined up right at each post, too. cool.', '2003-02-19 11:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(219123, 12368, 806, '<td valign="top">neat. the pattern in the glass is enough for me though. I think this could use a tighter crop. I would rather guess what is causing the pattern, than be told it is the leaves by including them in the shot. Would make it more abstract.</td>', 'neat. the pattern in the glass is enough for me though. I think this could use a tighter crop. I would rather guess what is causing the pattern, than be told it is the leaves by including them in the shot. Would make it more abstract.', '2003-02-19 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(219152, 12326, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great blue and wonderful detail.  My pick for the week, best of luck in the challenge</td>', 'Great blue and wonderful detail.  My pick for the week, best of luck in the challenge', '2003-02-19 12:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(219154, 12620, 3084, '<td valign="top">WOW, great image.  Wonderful colour, contrast, tone, and light.  Great job.  Shares the spot for my pick of the week, best of luck.</td>', 'WOW, great image.  Wonderful colour, contrast, tone, and light.  Great job.  Shares the spot for my pick of the week, best of luck.', '2003-02-19 12:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(219200, 12748, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice rhythm with the repeating patterns and contrast in this image... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice rhythm with the repeating patterns and contrast in this image... good work :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(219201, 12339, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand the ''rhythm'' idea you were going for here, but the photograph doesn''t really show the ''repeating pattern'' idea... the contrast also seems to be just a bit weak... - setzler</td>', 'I understand the ''rhythm'' idea you were going for here, but the photograph doesn''t really show the ''repeating pattern'' idea... the contrast also seems to be just a bit weak... - setzler', '2003-02-19 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(219216, 12646, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work with the light and composition on this one... the detail is also very good... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice work with the light and composition on this one... the detail is also very good... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(219249, 12731, 5318, '<td valign="top">play that FUNKY music white boy!  oops now your gonna have that tune in your head a day, great shot soni, cool colors , bold statment</td>', 'play that FUNKY music white boy!  oops now your gonna have that tune in your head a day, great shot soni, cool colors , bold statment', '2003-02-19 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(219292, 12646, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great! I love this, it is so deep! I think it might be just a tad too sharp but otherwise a ribbon photo. Good job!</td>', 'Great! I love this, it is so deep! I think it might be just a tad too sharp but otherwise a ribbon photo. Good job!', '2003-02-19 15:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(219298, 12493, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yummy Macaroni!!! You did a good a good job here. Although it is going a little darker to the right side I think you kept the overall brightness correct. Making it any brighter would have overdone the left side. Very sharp and in focus, you can be proud of this one.</td>', 'Yummy Macaroni!!! You did a good a good job here. Although it is going a little darker to the right side I think you kept the overall brightness correct. Making it any brighter would have overdone the left side. Very sharp and in focus, you can be proud of this one.', '2003-02-19 15:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(219355, 12748, 5585, '<td valign="top">My Favorite China....6</td>', 'My Favorite China....6', '2003-02-19 16:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(219391, 12566, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent pattern work with this shot... the blue looks excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent pattern work with this shot... the blue looks excellent :) - setzler', '2003-02-19 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(219414, 12613, 3706, '<td valign="top">Nature is it''s own canvas, way to catch it digitally!</td>', 'Nature is it''s own canvas, way to catch it digitally!', '2003-02-19 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(219501, 12359, 4007, '<td valign="top">I don''t think we get enough of the edge of the roof in the top right corner to add to the shot.  I''d either go wider and show more of the roof edge to give it more context, or else crop it to just the shingles themselves, which have enough pattern and color variation to stand completely on their own.  I think I''d prefer the latter. And that white stripe at the bottom of the shot has got to go, although I assume it''s there accidentally.  Great subject though. A 9 or 10 with a better crop. But I''ll give you an 8 because I could stare at those patterns all day even so.</td>', 'I don''t think we get enough of the edge of the roof in the top right corner to add to the shot.  I''d either go wider and show more of the roof edge to give it more context, or else crop it to just the shingles themselves, which have enough pattern and color variation to stand completely on their own.  I think I''d prefer the latter. And that white stripe at the bottom of the shot has got to go, although I assume it''s there accidentally.  Great subject though. A 9 or 10 with a better crop. But I''ll give you an 8 because I could stare at those patterns all day even so.', '2003-02-19 20:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(219505, 12620, 4007, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, colors, and multiple lines and patterns.  I like it. 7</td>', 'Nice texture, colors, and multiple lines and patterns.  I like it. 7', '2003-02-19 20:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(219508, 12326, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great color and the lighting that reflects more off the droplets in some parts of the shot than others creates a very cool effect.  Excellent work. 8</td>', 'Great color and the lighting that reflects more off the droplets in some parts of the shot than others creates a very cool effect.  Excellent work. 8', '2003-02-19 20:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(219517, 12339, 4007, '<td valign="top">The exposure seems too dark (especially on the upper right hand clock) and needs more contrast.  Your center clock, because it is asymetrical itself, seems to throw off the balance of the shot (which I think is vital to this shot).  The door frame on the right side should have been avoided.  It seems the shot is also tilted to the left.  The idea had some potential but the shot needs a lot of technical work.  Good luck. 3</td>', 'The exposure seems too dark (especially on the upper right hand clock) and needs more contrast.  Your center clock, because it is asymetrical itself, seems to throw off the balance of the shot (which I think is vital to this shot).  The door frame on the right side should have been avoided.  It seems the shot is also tilted to the left.  The idea had some potential but the shot needs a lot of technical work.  Good luck. 3', '2003-02-19 20:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(219524, 12736, 2716, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern.  Seems like a real good time.  Very original to take people as your subject for this challenge.  good job.</td>', 'Nice pattern.  Seems like a real good time.  Very original to take people as your subject for this challenge.  good job.', '2003-02-19 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(219526, 12368, 2716, '<td valign="top">That is a very beautiful effect.  I really like the reflection and the colours.  Good job.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'That is a very beautiful effect.  I really like the reflection and the colours.  Good job.  Jacko.  9', '2003-02-19 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219529, 12462, 4007, '<td valign="top">Your exposure is too dark to make out the boats at the bottom of the shot.  The sunset and sky themselves lack color or interesting patterns to add to the shot.  This seems like a good location for a sunset shot, so I''d try it again.  Experiment with different angles and zoom levels and I''ll bet you could get a very cool shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Your exposure is too dark to make out the boats at the bottom of the shot.  The sunset and sky themselves lack color or interesting patterns to add to the shot.  This seems like a good location for a sunset shot, so I''d try it again.  Experiment with different angles and zoom levels and I''ll bet you could get a very cool shot.  Good luck.', '2003-02-19 20:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(219530, 12394, 4007, '<td valign="top">Very cool subject. 8</td>', 'Very cool subject. 8', '2003-02-19 20:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(219590, 12326, 6711, '<td valign="top">coooooll</td>', 'coooooll', '2003-02-19 21:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(219620, 12696, 3205, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!!</td>', 'Nicely done!!', '2003-02-19 22:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(219630, 12608, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure if this is an example of rhythm, but I''m not docking for it.  Something about this shot seems missing or off to me, but I can''t really put my finger on it.  I think the crop is just too tight for my tastes. 5</td>', 'I''m not really sure if this is an example of rhythm, but I''m not docking for it.  Something about this shot seems missing or off to me, but I can''t really put my finger on it.  I think the crop is just too tight for my tastes. 5', '2003-02-19 22:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(219638, 12636, 5391, '<td valign="top">Funny - This caught myt eye because I told my husband about this challenge and the suggested this EXACT same idea...  Well executed.  Very nice lighting.  No hot spots or unwanted reflections.  Tricky to do well.  9</td>', 'Funny - This caught myt eye because I told my husband about this challenge and the suggested this EXACT same idea...  Well executed.  Very nice lighting.  No hot spots or unwanted reflections.  Tricky to do well.  9', '2003-02-19 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(219640, 12326, 5391, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Beautiful abstract.  9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Beautiful abstract.  9', '2003-02-19 22:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(219662, 12346, 1360, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how you did this. 7 -lennier</td>', 'I''d love to know how you did this. 7 -lennier', '2003-02-19 23:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(219665, 12359, 1360, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the "blue" cast in this image, though I do like its rhythm.</td>', 'I don''t like the "blue" cast in this image, though I do like its rhythm.', '2003-02-19 23:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(219712, 12426, 3280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color of blue but it seems a bit grainey from the low light.</td>', 'Beautiful color of blue but it seems a bit grainey from the low light.', '2003-02-19 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(219713, 12578, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I think I would have liked this better cropped a little closer on the left.</td>', 'Great colors.  I think I would have liked this better cropped a little closer on the left.', '2003-02-19 23:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(219715, 12654, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very cool, B/W is perfect here.</td>', 'Very cool, B/W is perfect here.', '2003-02-20 00:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(219716, 12629, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very rhthymic.  I might have cropped the white streak of snow(?) at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice shot, very rhthymic.  I might have cropped the white streak of snow(?) at the bottom.', '2003-02-20 00:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(219717, 12748, 3280, '<td valign="top">Could have worked for yellow too.  I like the lighting, I don;t think I would have cropped the cup though.</td>', 'Could have worked for yellow too.  I like the lighting, I don;t think I would have cropped the cup though.', '2003-02-20 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(219718, 12696, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good focus and I like the border.  It seems a little light in contrast though, almost as if the colors were washed out.</td>', 'Good focus and I like the border.  It seems a little light in contrast though, almost as if the colors were washed out.', '2003-02-20 00:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(219857, 12716, 4510, '<td valign="top">Good lighting but IMO the first pawn looks a little out of focus.</td>', 'Good lighting but IMO the first pawn looks a little out of focus.', '2003-02-20 07:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(219859, 12696, 4510, '<td valign="top">Not that it''s going to affect the score I give for this shot, I really don''t like the border.</td>', 'Not that it''s going to affect the score I give for this shot, I really don''t like the border.', '2003-02-20 07:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(219886, 12731, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting use of color, as well as shape and pattern... the centered composition seems to work really well here :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an interesting use of color, as well as shape and pattern... the centered composition seems to work really well here :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 08:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(219887, 12475, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... I love architectural designs like this one, and I think you got the rhythm idea down nicely here :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent shot... I love architectural designs like this one, and I think you got the rhythm idea down nicely here :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 08:34:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(219919, 12608, 2217, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast.  Neat idea.</td>', 'Very nice contrast.  Neat idea.', '2003-02-20 09:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(219921, 12568, 2217, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea.  Love it.</td>', 'Fantastic idea.  Love it.', '2003-02-20 09:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(219925, 12679, 2217, '<td valign="top">I feel that you should have shown more of whatever it is.  I feel a little let down because I can''t see what it is.  Nevertheless you have a good idea here.</td>', 'I feel that you should have shown more of whatever it is.  I feel a little let down because I can''t see what it is.  Nevertheless you have a good idea here.', '2003-02-20 10:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(219929, 12329, 2217, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Pity you didn''t show some more of the building, I feel that the bottom part of the building is cropped too much. Your picture is very interesting and the focus is good.</td>', 'Lovely.  Pity you didn''t show some more of the building, I feel that the bottom part of the building is cropped too much. Your picture is very interesting and the focus is good.', '2003-02-20 10:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(219931, 12498, 2217, '<td valign="top">Focus is perfect.  Your composition is great.  Nice picture</td>', 'Focus is perfect.  Your composition is great.  Nice picture', '2003-02-20 10:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(219932, 12359, 2217, '<td valign="top">pity you didn''t show a little more of the temple.  Good picture nevertheless<br/></td>', 'pity you didn''t show a little more of the temple.  Good picture nevertheless', '2003-02-20 10:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(219933, 12620, 2217, '<td valign="top">This is terrific.  Love it.</td>', 'This is terrific.  Love it.', '2003-02-20 10:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(219934, 12559, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot :)  I like the simplicity of this image... - setzler</td>', 'nice shot :)  I like the simplicity of this image... - setzler', '2003-02-20 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(219935, 12654, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot :)  the rhythm of the steps is good and the sharp contrast and grain work well in this image also... nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot :)  the rhythm of the steps is good and the sharp contrast and grain work well in this image also... nice work :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 10:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(219956, 12602, 5044, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered you not crop out the last rower. Also, framing the composition to show where they are going (as opposed to where they have been) would have worked better.</td>', 'I would have prefered you not crop out the last rower. Also, framing the composition to show where they are going (as opposed to where they have been) would have worked better.', '2003-02-20 12:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(219957, 12764, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very hard to see the vine rows. Picture is very dark.</td>', 'Very hard to see the vine rows. Picture is very dark.', '2003-02-20 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(219958, 12420, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very busy picture. Barbed wire should have been cropped out. IMO.</td>', 'Very busy picture. Barbed wire should have been cropped out. IMO.', '2003-02-20 12:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(219967, 12625, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.. this is one of the most unique interpretations of this challenge I have seen :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent work.. this is one of the most unique interpretations of this challenge I have seen :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(219969, 12716, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice work with the shallow depth of field... It looks like they ar floating in space :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice work with the shallow depth of field... It looks like they ar floating in space :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 12:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(220000, 12696, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow, incredible fibers!  The subtle reflections are awesome!</td>', 'Wow, incredible fibers!  The subtle reflections are awesome!', '2003-02-20 13:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(220001, 12588, 1379, '<td valign="top">Heh.... log rhythms....  Only a mathematician could really appreciate this.  I love it!</td>', 'Heh.... log rhythms....  Only a mathematician could really appreciate this.  I love it!', '2003-02-20 13:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(220002, 12496, 1379, '<td valign="top">The wood looks so rich and warm.  I love your light.</td>', 'The wood looks so rich and warm.  I love your light.', '2003-02-20 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(220003, 12596, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a gorgeous shot!  This could work for the stock photography challenge, too.  This is my favorite so far!</td>', 'Wow, what a gorgeous shot!  This could work for the stock photography challenge, too.  This is my favorite so far!', '2003-02-20 13:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(220005, 12339, 1379, '<td valign="top">All the clocks make this a pretty busy shot, and my eye can''t really figure out where to settle.  Maybe just one of them would have been better.</td>', 'All the clocks make this a pretty busy shot, and my eye can''t really figure out where to settle.  Maybe just one of them would have been better.', '2003-02-20 13:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(220006, 12394, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I love the way this vista stretches out all the way to the edges of the frame.  What an incredible scene.</td>', 'Awesome.  I love the way this vista stretches out all the way to the edges of the frame.  What an incredible scene.', '2003-02-20 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(220007, 12566, 1379, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh, I like it.  It looks almost like an electron microscope shot.  What is this stuff?  It''s really cool!</td>', 'Ooooooh, I like it.  It looks almost like an electron microscope shot.  What is this stuff?  It''s really cool!', '2003-02-20 13:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(220010, 12681, 1379, '<td valign="top">The Fibbonacci sequence!  Great capture!</td>', 'The Fibbonacci sequence!  Great capture!', '2003-02-20 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(220019, 12660, 772, '<td valign="top">The shadows seem to make a decent rhythm in this shot along with the red verticals... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'The shadows seem to make a decent rhythm in this shot along with the red verticals... good work :) - setzler', '2003-02-20 14:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(220021, 12737, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice angle for this shot... I"m not sure abou the lighting... the candle looks good but the rest is a little flat... - setzler</td>', 'Nice angle for this shot... I"m not sure abou the lighting... the candle looks good but the rest is a little flat... - setzler', '2003-02-20 14:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(220022, 12613, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful image... I believe the ''rhythm'' may be a little weak.. the repeating patterns are a little ''chaotic'' for me... - setzler</td>', 'this is a beautiful image... I believe the ''rhythm'' may be a little weak.. the repeating patterns are a little ''chaotic'' for me... - setzler', '2003-02-20 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(220039, 12666, 656, '<td valign="top">this is a potentially great subject and well seen.  I don''t know that you''ve made the best use of the subject matter though - the area of sky breaks up the composition, as do the people and cars.<br/> <br/>I''d love to see this taken more ''straight on'' from the other side of the street to really emphasize the patterns and also make more use of the great colour between the purple/red walls and the green escapes</td>', 'this is a potentially great subject and well seen.  I don''t know that you''ve made the best use of the subject matter though - the area of sky breaks up the composition, as do the people and cars. I''d love to see this taken more ''straight on'' from the other side of the street to really emphasize the patterns and also make more use of the great colour between the purple/red walls and the green escapes', '2003-02-20 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(220040, 12658, 656, '<td valign="top">lovely. I particularly like how it is not broken up at all.</td>', 'lovely. I particularly like how it is not broken up at all.', '2003-02-20 15:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(220041, 12662, 656, '<td valign="top">good eye to see and interpret this</td>', 'good eye to see and interpret this', '2003-02-20 15:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
