(220990, 12498, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I really like the color.  Good contrast and nice sharp focus.  IMO it might have been a little more rhythmic if the crop were just a bit tighter.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I really like the color.  Good contrast and nice sharp focus.  IMO it might have been a little more rhythmic if the crop were just a bit tighter.', '2003-02-22 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
