(220992, 12475, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  I really like this shot.  Very rhythmic.  Very interesting too.  I like the contrast in this show and the crop that was chosen.</td>', 'This is very nice.  I really like this shot.  Very rhythmic.  Very interesting too.  I like the contrast in this show and the crop that was chosen.', '2003-02-22 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(220993, 12745, 6097, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  One of my favorite fruit shots I have seen on this site.  I love how you alternated the melons to give the shot more appeal.  Very nice DOF.  One of my favorite rhythm shots in this challenge.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  One of my favorite fruit shots I have seen on this site.  I love how you alternated the melons to give the shot more appeal.  Very nice DOF.  One of my favorite rhythm shots in this challenge.', '2003-02-22 12:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(221001, 12559, 6097, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot. Very rhythmic.  I love the yellow stripe.  I know a lot of people don''t like borders but I think this would have looked nice with a thin yellow border.  I really like the two colors in this shot.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot. Very rhythmic.  I love the yellow stripe.  I know a lot of people don''t like borders but I think this would have looked nice with a thin yellow border.  I really like the two colors in this shot.', '2003-02-22 12:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(221002, 12346, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea!  I had though of this myself but I abandoned the idea and did something else.  I''m glad I didn''t do this shot because it wouldn''t have look this good.  Excellent job!  Very nice.  Good clarity and evenness.  Tick, tick, tick, tick, tick...  :-)</td>', 'Excellent idea!  I had though of this myself but I abandoned the idea and did something else.  I''m glad I didn''t do this shot because it wouldn''t have look this good.  Excellent job!  Very nice.  Good clarity and evenness.  Tick, tick, tick, tick, tick...  :-)', '2003-02-22 12:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
