(221196, 12596, 5475, '<td valign="top">Great repetitious pattern, and the colors are great.  I like that you shot this with a diagonal rather than straight on.  The objects in the background are enough to prevent a plain, boring black background, but are not enough to be a distraction from the main elements of the photo.  The board that the thread spools are sitting on has lots of character, but I would have liked it better if it were wider (going into the background.  The material used appears to be draped over boxes or other objects, but the object in the rear appears to have a higher elevation than the foreground, creating a small distraction behind the red spool.  Lighing is excellent, DOF is good.  Overall a very nice photo and I give it an 8 for this challenge.  A better ''platform'' for this shot would have gotten a 9 or 10 out of me!  Good luck in the challenge!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Great repetitious pattern, and the colors are great.  I like that you shot this with a diagonal rather than straight on.  The objects in the background are enough to prevent a plain, boring black background, but are not enough to be a distraction from the main elements of the photo.  The board that the thread spools are sitting on has lots of character, but I would have liked it better if it were wider (going into the background.  The material used appears to be draped over boxes or other objects, but the object in the rear appears to have a higher elevation than the foreground, creating a small distraction behind the red spool.  Lighing is excellent, DOF is good.  Overall a very nice photo and I give it an 8 for this challenge.  A better ''platform'' for this shot would have gotten a 9 or 10 out of me!  Good luck in the challenge!JD Anderson', '2003-02-22 17:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(221197, 12368, 5475, '<td valign="top">Congrats! My only 10 for this challenge.  I thought it was a really cool abstract at first, but I quickly realized it consists of a glass and some plant leaves, on mirror/glass.  A very nice set up, very clever and very appealing color and tone.  Your focus, DOF, clarity of detail, lighting, etc are all perfect.  There appears to be some falloff of DOF from the glass to the leaves, but I like that.  I think it helps the photo, rather than having the leaves crisp and sharp.  The patterns created in the liquid are wonderful.  The only thing I don;t like about this shot is the border you chose.  Yes, that color reflects similar colors in the image, but because of that, the border appears very weak and flat to me.  The dark green in the leaf on the bottom right might have been a better choiice of color for the border, IMHO.  I won''t knock your score for a border, though.  Everything else is perfect!  Great job!  10<br/> <br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Congrats! My only 10 for this challenge.  I thought it was a really cool abstract at first, but I quickly realized it consists of a glass and some plant leaves, on mirror/glass.  A very nice set up, very clever and very appealing color and tone.  Your focus, DOF, clarity of detail, lighting, etc are all perfect.  There appears to be some falloff of DOF from the glass to the leaves, but I like that.  I think it helps the photo, rather than having the leaves crisp and sharp.  The patterns created in the liquid are wonderful.  The only thing I don;t like about this shot is the border you chose.  Yes, that color reflects similar colors in the image, but because of that, the border appears very weak and flat to me.  The dark green in the leaf on the bottom right might have been a better choiice of color for the border, IMHO.  I won''t knock your score for a border, though.  Everything else is perfect!  Great job!  10 JD Anderson', '2003-02-22 17:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(221199, 12625, 5475, '<td valign="top">There are images in the challenge that have more visual appeal than this one, but this is the most clever by far!   Did you set this up?  Or was it your sharp eye that caught this repeating pattern?  either way, I like it a lot.  Is that a dress, or fancy pajamas???  If it''s fancy underwear/pajamas, then I''d be inclined to think this shot is set up.  Either way, I like it!  8  Good luck in the challenge!<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'There are images in the challenge that have more visual appeal than this one, but this is the most clever by far!   Did you set this up?  Or was it your sharp eye that caught this repeating pattern?  either way, I like it a lot.  Is that a dress, or fancy pajamas???  If it''s fancy underwear/pajamas, then I''d be inclined to think this shot is set up.  Either way, I like it!  8  Good luck in the challenge!JD Anderson', '2003-02-22 17:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(221200, 12699, 5475, '<td valign="top">OK, so this is really cool.  I like your use of props here.  Colors are good, too.  Nice job.  8  JD Anderson</td>', 'OK, so this is really cool.  I like your use of props here.  Colors are good, too.  Nice job.  8  JD Anderson', '2003-02-22 17:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(221201, 12568, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I like the contrast between the very sharp details of the drum and the fluid blur of the hands in motion.  Not exactly the rhythm talked about in the challenge description, but I''m scoring it well anyway because I like this shot, and it is rhythm by other standards!  Well done!  8<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I like the contrast between the very sharp details of the drum and the fluid blur of the hands in motion.  Not exactly the rhythm talked about in the challenge description, but I''m scoring it well anyway because I like this shot, and it is rhythm by other standards!  Well done!  8JD Anderson', '2003-02-22 17:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(221218, 12371, 5728, '<td valign="top">Das Bild gefaelt mir sehr! Die Flagge sieht so klar aus unter''m Wasser und ich mag gerne wie die Farben so deutlich durchscheinen. Die kleinen Wellen bringen sehr viel Charachter rein. Ein tolles Bild, gratuliere!</td>', 'Das Bild gefaelt mir sehr! Die Flagge sieht so klar aus unter''m Wasser und ich mag gerne wie die Farben so deutlich durchscheinen. Die kleinen Wellen bringen sehr viel Charachter rein. Ein tolles Bild, gratuliere!', '2003-02-22 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
