(221230, 12326, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting work.. i love the shade of blue in this shot.. the ''clear'' space on the right offers a nice upset of the balance of the image.. nice work :)  - setzler</td>', 'very interesting work.. i love the shade of blue in this shot.. the ''clear'' space on the right offers a nice upset of the balance of the image.. nice work :)  - setzler', '2003-02-22 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
