(221643, 12646, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the patter you have here. The shot is crisp and the lighting is excellent. One of my top 10 this week!</td>', 'I like the patter you have here. The shot is crisp and the lighting is excellent. One of my top 10 this week!', '2003-02-23 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(221646, 12368, 4493, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of refraction. The pattern is unique and so clear. Excellent lighting. Perfect shot! In my top 10 this week!</td>', 'Excellent use of refraction. The pattern is unique and so clear. Excellent lighting. Perfect shot! In my top 10 this week!', '2003-02-23 14:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
