(221652, 12760, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the combination of the moon with the cold steel structure. This is a very nice shot! It''s in my top 10 this week!</td>', 'I like the combination of the moon with the cold steel structure. This is a very nice shot! It''s in my top 10 this week!', '2003-02-23 14:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
