(221657, 12475, 4493, '<td valign="top">The curves presented here in contrast to the hard lines of the building make for a nice composition. I also like the crop at the top and bottom, it is a very pleasing symetery. Your decision to desaturate was also good, it makes the steel of the stairs seem that much cooler. Great shot, in my top 10 this week!</td>', 'The curves presented here in contrast to the hard lines of the building make for a nice composition. I also like the crop at the top and bottom, it is a very pleasing symetery. Your decision to desaturate was also good, it makes the steel of the stairs seem that much cooler. Great shot, in my top 10 this week!', '2003-02-23 14:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(221659, 12662, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective. This is a good shot with very good leading lines. It''s in my top 10 this week!</td>', 'Very unique perspective. This is a good shot with very good leading lines. It''s in my top 10 this week!', '2003-02-23 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(221698, 12398, 2011, '<td valign="top">I think you may have over sharpened this a little too much.  On my monitor a faint out line shows right around the belly.Good idea though.  Wish I could do that.</td>', 'I think you may have over sharpened this a little too much.  On my monitor a faint out line shows right around the belly.Good idea though.  Wish I could do that.', '2003-02-23 17:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(221703, 12667, 2011, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, and would have worked well in the Perspective challenge too.</td>', 'This is really nice, and would have worked well in the Perspective challenge too.', '2003-02-23 17:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(221711, 12699, 6405, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10</td>', 'Perfect 10', '2003-02-23 18:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(221712, 12731, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice light effect ,perfect 10</td>', 'Nice light effect ,perfect 10', '2003-02-23 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(221726, 12475, 2011, '<td valign="top">I can almost SEE the music in this shot. 10</td>', 'I can almost SEE the music in this shot. 10', '2003-02-23 19:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(221731, 12759, 326, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Wonderful shot!', '2003-02-23 19:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(221745, 12339, 3102, '<td valign="top">To me it seems a little too "tossed together"... a little too random, even though there are numerous clocks involved.  The railing that runs vertically along the right hand side is also a bit distracting.</td>', 'To me it seems a little too "tossed together"... a little too random, even though there are numerous clocks involved.  The railing that runs vertically along the right hand side is also a bit distracting.', '2003-02-23 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(221746, 12752, 3102, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the week!  Very nice.  It''s a shame that the window is so bright... otherwise this would be a 10.</td>', 'One of my favorites of the week!  Very nice.  It''s a shame that the window is so bright... otherwise this would be a 10.', '2003-02-23 19:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(221747, 12689, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, although it strikes me as having just a bit too much sky.  I would have liked it a little better had it been panned down just a tad.</td>', 'A very nice shot, although it strikes me as having just a bit too much sky.  I would have liked it a little better had it been panned down just a tad.', '2003-02-23 19:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(221749, 12625, 6100, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the lights follow the lady''s back. You either got a GREAT grab shot or you set this up beautifully!</td>', 'I really like the way the lights follow the lady''s back. You either got a GREAT grab shot or you set this up beautifully!', '2003-02-23 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(221750, 12629, 6100, '<td valign="top">You have a good eye to have noticed the patterns here and you captured it very well and in great contrast. I know I''m so tired of the snow, I''m not really looking at it anymore.</td>', 'You have a good eye to have noticed the patterns here and you captured it very well and in great contrast. I know I''m so tired of the snow, I''m not really looking at it anymore.', '2003-02-23 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(221751, 12326, 6100, '<td valign="top">Well captured. The droplets stand out very nicely.</td>', 'Well captured. The droplets stand out very nicely.', '2003-02-23 20:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(221754, 12716, 6100, '<td valign="top">I like the job you did here. The fading out-of-focus makes me think that these pawns are marching off to my left and that there are many more of them to come! I like the way you''ve gotten everything else to be black. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the job you did here. The fading out-of-focus makes me think that these pawns are marching off to my left and that there are many more of them to come! I like the way you''ve gotten everything else to be black. Nice job!', '2003-02-23 20:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(221755, 12566, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice pattern and a very clear closeup. You''ve met the challenge quite well. The monochrome adds to the picture.</td>', 'Nice pattern and a very clear closeup. You''ve met the challenge quite well. The monochrome adds to the picture.', '2003-02-23 20:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(221756, 12498, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I can''t see where the beginning (or the end, for that matter) is so it''s quite intriguing. The black background helps the image stand out.</td>', 'Nice job. I can''t see where the beginning (or the end, for that matter) is so it''s quite intriguing. The black background helps the image stand out.', '2003-02-23 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(221810, 12688, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very clever set-up.</td>', 'Very clever set-up.', '2003-02-23 21:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
