(221962, 12329, 51167, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen that sunstone before.  I''ll have to check back after the challenge to see where this was taken.  My guess is Nauvoo Temple.  I''ve never seen it though.  If it is I''d like to see your shots of the whole thing.</td>', 'I''ve seen that sunstone before.  I''ll have to check back after the challenge to see where this was taken.  My guess is Nauvoo Temple.  I''ve never seen it though.  If it is I''d like to see your shots of the whole thing.', '2003-02-23 23:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(221989, 12398, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hehe, I knew this one would score pretty low, but I got so sick of the style of photos I''ve been taking lately. I wanted to break out and do something colourful, unfocussed and wild.<br/> <br/>The "overprocessed" look is there because I had to use despeckle. My camera has a horrible scattering of hot pixels on long exposure shots. I like the end result though, personally.</td>', 'Hehe, I knew this one would score pretty low, but I got so sick of the style of photos I''ve been taking lately. I wanted to break out and do something colourful, unfocussed and wild. The "overprocessed" look is there because I had to use despeckle. My camera has a horrible scattering of hot pixels on long exposure shots. I like the end result though, personally.', '2003-02-24 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
