(419728, 12740, 2883, '<td valign="top">The trails from the ducks are very well captured. The problem I find in this photo is the loss of color due to the heavy contrasts. The ducks are lost as a point of focus in the photo due to the dark grass that is also in the water. I do like the one duck looking back to the other, as if saying, "Quit lagging behind!"</td>', 'The trails from the ducks are very well captured. The problem I find in this photo is the loss of color due to the heavy contrasts. The ducks are lost as a point of focus in the photo due to the dark grass that is also in the water. I do like the one duck looking back to the other, as if saying, "Quit lagging behind!"', '2003-09-15 14:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
